      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't even know if that is possible on a technical level, since once it is deleted there is no information attached to that Avatar ID, so there would be no way of it knowing who made it since it just doesn't exist anymore / has no data linked to that it.\nIf it would be possible which means they would need to store information about an Avatar which is deleted it would be a cool feature.",
