  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-12-31T08:21:00.267Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some avatars that gets deleted or privated by the author, but we don't get to see if they made a dedicated world to their works; or if they updated the avatar to be found in their world.\nIt would've been nice to still be able to see who made the avatar before it was deleted, so we can still keep up-to-date with their content.",
